---
/*
 * DESIGN.md 8.6: no illustration, no mascot. A missing page is a typographic
 * fact, and the useful part of the page is the way back out — so the routes are
 * the content, in all three languages, because a reader who reached a dead URL
 * may not have arrived through their own language's tree.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="zh" title="404" noindex>
  <section class="measure measure--media not-found">
    <p class="not-found__code">404</p>
    <h1>这里没有这个页面。</h1>
    <p>地址可能写错了，或者这篇文章已经改名、下线。下面几个入口都还在。</p>
    <nav aria-label="回到站内">
      <a href="/zh/">首页</a>
      <a href="/zh/writing/">全部文章</a>
      <a href="/zh/archive/">归档</a>
      <a href="/ja/" lang="ja-JP">日本語</a>
      <a href="/en/" lang="en-US">English</a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
